  "_comment": [
    "The orchestrator suite, and the reads each of its test files makes outside genesis/orchestrator (E11).",
    "suite-run.mjs runs it from this list, in these groups, in this order; package.json test runs `node suite-run.mjs all`.",
    "A file with reads is a named file: the orchestrator gate keys on the union of these reads (gate-evidence.mjs readSetAt)",
    "and runs the file under read-fence.mjs, which fails the gate naming any read or child the declaration does not cover.",
    "A read is an exact path, a directory prefix, a submodule gitlink path (never a path inside one), or a **/<name> walk.",
    "A file with tree is keyed on the whole commit tree: it runs in the orchestrator-tree gate project, with its reason.",
    "notInSuite names the test files under genesis/orchestrator that no orchestrator recipe runs; suite-list.test.mjs fails on any other."
